{
  "name": "Post new Shopify products to Instagram and Facebook with Rizamo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post new Shopify products\n\nA new product in Shopify becomes a post in your Rizamo queue, with its first photo, its title, a short description and its link.\n\n### Setup\n1. In Rizamo, open **Developers** and create an API key.\n2. In n8n, add a **Rizamo API** credential with it.\n3. Install the node first if needed: Settings, Community Nodes, `@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo`.\n4. Connect Shopify in **New product**.\n5. In **Add to queue**, pick the profile and accounts, and replace your-store.com with your store's address.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 520
      },
      "id": "4abcc839-ef6c-41ce-acf8-11696b91d181",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "topic": "products/create"
      },
      "id": "f3db2675-694c-4132-9da2-d9b8cf89a408",
      "name": "New product",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.shopifyTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "create",
        "profileId": "",
        "accountIds": [],
        "text": "=New in: {{ $json.title }}\n\n{{ ($json.body_html || '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 220) }}\n\nhttps://your-store.com/products/{{ $json.handle }}",
        "when": "queue",
        "mediaSource": "urls",
        "mediaUrls": "={{ $json.image?.src || ($json.images?.[0]?.src ?? '') }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "alt": "={{ $json.title }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "2f959579-85bb-4555-a61d-db4d0917e609",
      "name": "Add to queue",
      "type": "@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo.rizamo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New product": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Add to queue",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
